            <ArticleTitle>Postoperative injuries of upper limb nerves.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>128-30</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Three cases of different types of nerve injuries following orthopedic and chest surgery are described. Recovery from these nerve injuries was prolonged and incomplete. By constant awareness of potential nerve damage during operation, it is possible to prevent such injuries.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
